{"code":"N1","wikidata":"Q6633184","wikipedia":{"en":"Ratchathewi station","th":"สถานีราชเทวี"},"summary":{"en":"Ratchathewi station is a BTS skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Ratchathewi District, Bangkok, Thailand. In the future, it will become an interchange station for the MRT Orange Line following the opening of the western extension in 2030. The station is located on Phaya Thai Road to the south of Ratchathewi intersection, about 10 minutes walk to Pantip Plaza on the way to Pratunam market.","th":"สถานีราชเทวี เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพญาไทในพื้นที่เขตราชเทวี กรุงเทพมหานคร มีโครงการเชื่อมต่อกับรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายสีส้ม ในอนาคต"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/BTS_Ratchathewi.jpg/960px-BTS_Ratchathewi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Ratchathewi.jpg","author":"Sry85","license":"CC BY 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/201701_Platforms_of_Ratchathewi_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Platforms_of_Ratchathewi_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Platforms_of_Ratchathewi_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/201701_Ratchathewi_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Ratchathewi_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Ratchathewi_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Amazing_Thailand_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg/960px-Amazing_Thailand_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.